or":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wFea","author":{"login":"ljapptest-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 📝 CLAUDE.md Template Submission\n\nI've created a comprehensive CLAUDE.md template for Next.js SaaS applications.\n\n### ✅ Deliverables\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/claude-md-template\n\n### ✅ Acceptance Criteria Met\n\n- [x] **Comprehensive CLAUDE.md covering**:\n  - Project architecture\n  - Key conventions\n  - Database schema\n  - API routes\n  - Authentication flow\n  - Testing strategy\n  - Deployment steps\n- [x] **Works with popular Next.js starters**: create-next-app, Nextacular, Shipfast\n- [x] **Example prompts for common tasks**: 5 ready-to-use prompts\n- [x] **Tested with 2+ SaaS starters**: Verified compatibility\n\n### 📦 What's Included\n\n**Architecture**:\n- Tech stack (Next.js 14+, TypeScript, Prisma, NextAuth, Stripe)\n- Complete folder structure\n- File naming conventions\n\n**Database**:\n- User, Account, Subscription, AuditLog models\n- Migration commands\n- Prisma best practices\n\n**Authentication**:\n- NextAuth.js setup\n- OAuth + Email providers\n- Protected routes middleware\n\n**API Routes**:\n- Common endpoint reference\n- Webhook security pattern\n- Error handling\n\n**Testing**:\n- Unit tests (Jest + Testing Library)\n- Integration tests\n- E2E tests (Playwright)\n\n**Deployment**:\n- Environment variables\n- Vercel deployment\n- Docker deployment\n\n**Example Prompts**:\n- Create a new feature\n- Add authentication\n- Create API endpoint\n- Add Stripe integration\n- Write tests\n\n### 🔗 Links\n\n- **Code**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/claude-md-template\n- **CLAUDE.md**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/claude-md-template/blob/main/CLAUDE.md\n- **README**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/claude-md-template/blob/main/README.md\n\nReady for review! 🎉","createdAt":"2026-03-27T02:59:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com