ely.","createdAt":"2026-03-30T18:08:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4157077109","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M735go6","author":{"login":"TiagoAlmeidaS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"🤖 **OpenCode Agent — Skipped**\n\nThis issue requires UI mockups or design assets, which are outside the scope of a code-generation agent.\n\nThe agent handles: source code, tests, documentation, CI configuration.","createdAt":"2026-03-31T00:40:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4159048250","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M737z0A","author":{"login":"yuliuyi717-ux"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\\n\\nImplemented this and opened a PR with the `CLAUDE.md` template, validation notes, and tests for the required sections and opinionated rules.","createdAt":"2026-03-31T03:40:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4159651072","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M739jLh","author":{"login":"1150654748m-dev"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-31T05:53:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4160107233","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M74Ai6p","author":{"login":"zlplzp123wyt"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nPR submitted: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/345","createdAt":"2026-03-31T08:36:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimized