sMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4703487184","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABGFtoog","author":{"login":"chrisyangxiaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## PR #2785 质量大幅提升\n\n@maintainer 我已大幅改进 PR #2785 的 CLAUDE.md 质量，现提供**完整生产级模板**（15 个章节，~15,000 字）。\n\n### 覆盖对比\n| 章节 | PR #2284 | **PR #2785 (本 PR)** |\n|------|-----------|------------------------|\n| 技术栈与版本锁定 | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 项目结构 + 决策理由 | ✅ | ✅ 更详细 |\n| 数据库约定（完整 Schema） | 部分 | ✅ **完整（users/accounts/subscriptions/auditLogs）** |\n| Server/Client Component 模式 | ❌ | ✅ **完整示例** |\n| API Route 规范（REST + Webhook） | ❌ | ✅ **完整示例** |\n| 认证规范（NextAuth.js v5） | ❌ | ✅ **完整配置** |\n| 测试策略（单元/API/E2E） | ❌ | ✅ **Vitest + supertest + Playwright** |\n| 部署指南（Vercel + Docker） | ❌ | ✅ |\n| AI 提示词模板 | ❌ | ✅ **3 个实用示例** |\n| 反模式（5 个常见错误） | 部分 | ✅ **完整可运行对比** |\n| 故障排查 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 性能优化清单 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 贡献者注意事项 | ❌ | ✅ |\n\n### 质量保证\n- ✅ 所有代码示例完整可运行（非伪代码）\n- ✅ 遵循 Issue #2 所有验收标准\n- ✅ Opinionated — 每条规则都有理由说明\n- ✅ 可直接用于绿色项目（greenfield）\n\n根据 Opire 规则，赏金应归属**提供最高质量解决方案**的贡献者。请维护者 review 两个 PR 并选择质量更高的合并。\n\n如需任何修改，请随时告知！","createdAt":"2026-06-15T00:36:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4703611042","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABGFwbag","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #2\n\nProfessional clarification after @chrisyangxiaoqi's quality-comparison note on PR #2785:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4703611042\n\nMy active earlier issue #2 submission remains PR #2284:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2284\n\nCurrent contributor-side state rechecked now:\n- PR #2284 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports merge state `CLEAN` / mergeable.\n- PR body includes `/claim #2` and `Closes #2`.\n- Verification evidence is already in the PR body: `validate-template.mjs` reports 19 headings, 77 reasoned rules, 9 anti-patterns, and 10 smoke-test steps; `smoke-greenfield.sh` verifies a blank Next.js-style project flow; `git diff --check` passed.\n\nI am not asking maintainers to skip review of newer PRs. This comment is only to keep the earlier ready claim and its verification evidence visible after a later same-issue comparison comment.","createdAt":"2026-06-15T00:50:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4703656810","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABGHLyPg","author":{"login":"amoghacloud"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-06-15T06:27:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4705153598","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABGHaLPQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/claim #2\n\nVisibility refresh after @amoghacloud's new same-issue activity:\n- latest `/opire try`: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2#issuecomment-4705153598\n- competitor PR: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2791\n\nMy earlier in-repository issue #2 submission remains PR #2284:\n- PR: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2284\n- status from current refresh: open, non-draft, clean\n- claim/evidence: PR body includes `/claim #2` and `Closes #2`\n\nNo contributor-side blocker found on my side in this refresh.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-15T07:07:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactio